<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-754] Cannot use S3 seoul region (ap-northeast-2)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-754</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;S3NotebookRepo uses aws-java-sdk-s3@1.10.1 which does not support seoul region (ap-northeast-2).&lt;br/&gt;
Need to update 1.10.45 or later&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://aws.amazon.com/releasenotes/Java/2157535800302528&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://aws.amazon.com/releasenotes/Java/2157535800302528&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
